.TH WFLOW 1 "2026-10-21" "wflow 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
wflow \- high-performance native AI voice dictation
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wflow
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Wflow
captures your microphone while a global push-to-talk hotkey is held, streams the
audio to the configured speech-to-text provider and pastes the transcript into
the focused text box. It lives in the system tray and can be toggled with a
global hotkey.
.PP
Dictations are stored in a local SQLite database and can be searched, copied
and re-inserted from the History tab.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-startup
Start minimized in the system tray (used by the autostart entry).
.TP
.B \-\-check\-updates
Query the release feed, print the newest version and exit.
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Print the usage summary and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/wflow/config.json
Non-secret preferences.
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/wflow/secrets.json
API keys and session tokens. Created with 0600 permissions.
.TP
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/wflow/flow.sqlite
Local dictation history, vocabulary and snippets.
.TP
.I $XDG_STATE_HOME/wflow/logs/
Rotating diagnostic logs.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B RUST_LOG
Log filter, for example
.BR info ", " debug " or " wflow=trace .
.TP
.B WFLOW_AUTH_TOKEN
Overrides the stored Wispr Flow session token.
.TP
.B WFLOW_GROQ_API_KEY
Overrides the stored Groq API key.
.TP
.B WFLOW_ELEVENLABS_API_KEY
Overrides the stored ElevenLabs API key.
.TP
.B WFLOW_BASETEN_API_KEY
Overrides the stored gRPC gateway key.
.TP
.B WFLOW_UPDATE_REPO
GitHub repository used by the update checker.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
The update check failed.
.SH SEE ALSO
Project homepage: https://github.com/redpotion39/wflow
